[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 34621.426, "timestamp": "09:37:01", "text": "蘋果很難嗎？呃，好的。我有。好的，給你，我的火把堆。我[音樂]來了。你有一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34628.15, "timestamp": "09:37:08", "text": "非常深的洞穴。離開。走。哦，等等，等等，等等，在哪裡？哦，我的天哪，夥計，停下，走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34639.746, "timestamp": "09:37:19", "text": "呃，我去。 [音樂]睡覺。哦，我的天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34643.79, "timestamp": "09:37:23", "text": "我甚至睡不著。啊，我的，這東西被靜音了，我的錯。入口在哪裡？嗯，我正在考慮建造一個鐵路系統。現在，哪個？連接如此緊密，以至於你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34660.23, "timestamp": "09:37:40", "text": "甚至不必滑下來，哦，這是……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 34676.175, "timestamp": "09:37:56", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yahoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34678.746, "timestamp": "09:37:58", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 34678.94, "timestamp": "09:37:58", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! MINK~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}]